mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\npinterest-seo is the **keyword / search-ranking layer** — it researches the queries and writes the keyworded\nwords that make a pin rank. The agent **researches + writes the title/description + specs the on-pin keyword +\nadvises the board/link**; **WoopSocial publishes the pin's title + description + board + link**; **profile,\nboard setup, alt text, Rich Pins, and the research tools are native/advised.**\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent** researches keywords (**advises the method** — autocomplete + Guided Search bubbles + Trends —\n  and **never fabricates volume**), writes the **keyword-led pin title (≤100)** + **description**\n  (`content.text`, natural, no stuffing), **specs the on-pin overlay keyword** (rendered by an image tool),\n  and **advises** board names/descriptions + a **keyword-aligned link.**\n- **WoopSocial publishes** the pin's **title (≤100) + description + board (`pinterestBoardId`) + link\n  (≤2048)** — the **publishable SEO surfaces.**\n- **WoopSocial does NOT:** set **profile name/bio** keywords, **create/rename/describe boards**, set **alt\n  text** or **image file names**, **claim the website** or enable **Rich Pins**, query **Pinterest Trends/\n  autocomplete/Analytics**, or render the **on-pin text** — all **native/human** (the agent advises them).\n- **No keyword stuffing / over-optimization** (recognized + suppressed); **natural language.** **Pin → Board\n  → Page must actually match** (the page delivers the pin's promise — no misleading). **Fresh pins, not\n  dupes.** **Never fabricate search volume or rankings.** **Verify-quarterly.**\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **pinterest-seo (this)** — the **keyword / search-RANKING layer** (research + keyworded title/description +\n  board alignment).\n- **pinterest-pin-design** — the **VISUAL craft** (2:3, overlay, focal point). **They PAIR:** the keyword\n  goes in the **overlay AND the title.**\n- **pinterest-growth** — the **account / visual-search STRATEGY** (boards, link-out, evergreen, fresh-pin\n  cadence).\n- **social-seo** — **cross-cutting** platform search (TikTok/IG/YouTube broadly); this is **Pinterest-specific\n  depth** (autocomplete/Guided Search/Trends/board alignment/Rich Pins).\n- **ai-search-optimization** — being cited by **AI engines** (optimized pins also influence AI visual/product\n  results). **hashtag-strategy** — Pinterest **deprioritizes hashtags** (keywords win).\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile` (niche/voice), the **destination** (the page the pin links to).\n- **Pairs with:** `pinterest-pin-design` (the keyword in the overlay + title), `caption-writer` (the\n  description), `ideogram` (the on-pin keyword overlay).\n- **Routes to / from:** `pinterest-growth` (the strategy/cadence), `content-recycling` (fresh variations of an\n  evergreen URL), `social-seo`/`ai-search-optimization` (the cross-platform search picture),\n  `link-in-bio-and-traffic` (the destination).\n- **Publishes via:** `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial` (title + description + board + link) +\n  `platform-specs-and-validation`. **Measures with:** native **Pinterest Analytics** + `analytics-and-\n  reporting` (saves, long clicks, search impressions). **Profile, board setup, alt text, Rich Pins + the\n  research tools stay native/human.**\n"
